    "long_instructions": "#AI Image Generation \r\n\r\nAs you design your system diagram, use this AI Chat to assist with generating icons to  represent unique parts of your sustainable system.\r\n\r\nSave your image(s) into the Backpack to use in Sketch Lab.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Image Generation Starters:**\r\n\r\n* \"Can you create an icon to represent a gear?\"\r\n* \"Create an icon to represent a user\"\r\n* \"Generate an icon of a tablet that I can use as a background image.\"\r\n",
