      "levelSystemPrompt": "You will generate an image based on what the user inputs in the following style: \nA single flat vector icon in a \"lineal color\" icon style.\nFlat color fills with no gradients, using a limited palette: sky blue/cyan (#4FB3E8), navy (#1E3A5F), sunny yellow (#FFD23F), lime green (#8CC63F), light gray (#D9DEE3), and a small\naccent of coral pink (#F2637E) only where needed. Add one simple flat highlight or shadow band on the main shape for depth. Minimal detail and simplified geometry, like an icon drawn on a 64x64 grid. Front-facing or slight 3/4 view, centered, filling about 80% of the frame. Plain white background, no border, no frame, no text, no labels.",
